# Prisma CLI loads .env from this package directory.
# Reuses the monorepo root DATABASE_URL (do not commit secrets — this file is gitignored via *.env patterns if present).
# If migrate/push fails with "DATABASE_URL not found", either copy root .env here or run:
#   $env:DATABASE_URL = (Select-String -Path ..\..\.env -Pattern '^DATABASE_URL=').Line.Split('=',2)[1]
